{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1348619-just-got-the-books-have-noob-questions","id":1348619,"title":"Just got the books, have noob questions.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-14T23:19:51-08:00","id":1348619,"title":"Just got the books, have noob questions.","content":"I just got my KS books in the mail - both the core and Aeon are gorgeous hardcovers, and it is cool to reexperience the Continuum. That said, I do have some troubles wrapping my head around the system, so with all die apologies if these questions have been asked before (I looked, but there is... a lot here) I thought this could be the place where I ask the more experienced people how to tie my shoelaces etc.<br /> <br /> First off: What is the dice pool that you roll for Psi powers? I can\u00b4t seem to find a clear reference; the description of the Psi attribute mentions that it &quot;contributes to the dice pool&quot;, and the Psi powers chapter just mentions &quot;roll the dice pool&quot;. Is it *just* Psi? That seems a little low to me, especially with the standard TN being 8 now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11591-iron-seraph","name":"Iron Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11591_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T23:35:13-08:00","id":1348620,"title":"","content":"Page 206 under Activating Psi Powers<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Activating psionic powers usually requires an or- dinary action. The character spends the required Psi points and the player rolls the dice pool against the Difficulty. <b><i>A character\u2019s dice pool always equals her Psi Trait plus the number of dots she has in the Mode she is using.\u200b</i></b> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T23:40:39-08:00","id":1348621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1348619-just-got-the-books-have-noob-questions?p=1348620#post1348620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Page 206 under Activating Psi Powers<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Much obliged!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11591-iron-seraph","name":"Iron Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11591_2.jpeg","tit